{"speciesId":196,"names":{"fr":"Mentali","es":"Espeon","en":"Espeon","ja":"エーフィ"},"descriptions":[{"language":"en","version":"gold","text":"It uses the fine hair that covers its body to sense air currents and predict its ene­ my's actions."},{"language":"en","version":"silver","text":"By reading air currents, it can predict things such as the weath­ er or its foe's next move."},{"language":"en","version":"crystal","text":"The tip of its forked tail quivers when it is predicting its opponent's next move."},{"language":"en","version":"ruby","text":"ESPEON is extremely loyal to any TRAINER it considers to be worthy. It is said that this POKéMON developed its precognitive powers to protect its TRAINER from harm."},{"language":"en","version":"sapphire","text":"ESPEON is extremely loyal to any TRAINER it considers to be worthy. It is said that this POKéMON developed its precognitive powers to protect its TRAINER from harm."},{"language":"en","version":"emerald","text":"An ESPEON is extremely loyal to any TRAINER it considers to be worthy. It is said to have developed precognitive powers to protect its TRAINER from harm."},{"language":"en","version":"firered","text":"By reading air currents, it can predict things such as the weather or its foe’s next move."},{"language":"en","version":"leafgreen","text":"It uses the fine hair that covers its body to sense air currents and predict its enemy’s actions."},{"language":"en","version":"diamond","text":"Its fur has the look and feel of velvet. The orb on its forehead glows when it uses psycho-power."},{"language":"en","version":"pearl","text":"Its fur has the look and feel of velvet. The orb on its forehead glows when it uses psycho-power."},{"language":"en","version":"platinum","text":"Its fur is so sensitive, it can sense minute shifts in the air and predict the weather."},{"language":"en","version":"heartgold","text":"It uses the fine hair that covers its body to sense air currents and predict its enemy’s actions."},{"language":"en","version":"soulsilver","text":"By reading air currents, it can predict things such as the weather or its foe’s next move."},{"language":"fr","version":"black","text":"Sa fourrure est si sensible qu’il peut détecter les vibrations de l’air et prédire le temps qu’il fera."},{"language":"en","version":"black","text":"Its fur is so sensitive, it can sense minute shifts in the air and predict the weather."},{"language":"fr","version":"white","text":"Sa fourrure est si sensible qu’il peut détecter les vibrations de l’air et prédire le temps qu’il fera."},{"language":"en","version":"white","text":"Its fur is so sensitive, it can sense minute shifts in the air and predict the weather."},{"language":"en","version":"black-2","text":"Its fur is so sensitive, it can feel minute shifts in the air and predict the weather...and its foes’ thoughts."},{"language":"en","version":"white-2","text":"Its fur is so sensitive, it can feel minute shifts in the air and predict the weather...and its foes’ thoughts."},{"language":"fr","version":"x","text":"Le bout fourchu de sa queue frémit lorsqu’il prédit la prochaine attaque de son adversaire."},{"language":"es","version":"x","text":"Al predecir el siguiente movimiento de su rival, chasquea el extremo de la cola bífida que tiene."},{"language":"en","version":"x","text":"The tip of its forked tail quivers when it is predicting its opponent’s next move."},{"language":"ja","version":"x","text":"相手の 動きを 予知するとき ふたまたに なっている 尻尾の 先は 微妙に 揺れている。"},{"language":"fr","version":"y","text":"Sa fourrure ultrasensible détecte les vibrations de l’air. Il peut ainsi prédire le temps ou lire les pensées adverses."},{"language":"es","version":"y","text":"Su pelaje es tan sensible que percibe los cambios en el aire y predice así los ataques de sus enemigos y el tiempo."},{"language":"en","version":"y","text":"Its fur is so sensitive, it can feel minute shifts in the air and predict the weather...and its foes’ thoughts."},{"language":"ja","version":"y","text":"全身の 細やかな 体毛で 空気の 流れを 感じて 敵の 考えや 天候を 予測する。"},{"language":"fr","version":"omega-ruby","text":"Mentali est extrêmement loyal envers les Dresseurs qu’il respecte. On raconte que ce Pokémon a développé des talents divinatoires pour protéger son Dresseur."},{"language":"es","version":"omega-ruby","text":"Espeon es tremendamente leal al Entrenador al que considera digno de ello. Dicen que este Pokémon desarrolló sus poderes adivinatorios para evitar que su Entrenador sufra daño alguno."},{"language":"en","version":"omega-ruby","text":"Espeon is extremely loyal to any Trainer it considers to be worthy. It is said that this Pokémon developed its precognitive powers to protect its Trainer from harm."},{"language":"ja","version":"omega-ruby","text":"認めた トレーナーには 極めて 忠実。 トレーナーを 危険から 守る ために 予知能力が 発達したと いわれている。"},{"language":"fr","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"Mentali est extrêmement loyal envers les Dresseurs qu’il respecte. On raconte que ce Pokémon a développé des talents divinatoires pour protéger son Dresseur."},{"language":"es","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"Espeon es tremendamente leal al Entrenador al que considera digno de ello. Dicen que este Pokémon desarrolló sus poderes adivinatorios para evitar que su Entrenador sufra daño alguno."},{"language":"en","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"Espeon is extremely loyal to any Trainer it considers to be worthy. It is said that this Pokémon developed its precognitive powers to protect its Trainer from harm."},{"language":"ja","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"認めた トレーナーには 極めて 忠実。 トレーナーを 危険から 守る ために 予知能力が 発達したと いわれている。"},{"language":"fr","version":"sun","text":"Son pelage court et clairsemé détecte en un instant le moindre mouvement de l’air ou de l’ennemi."},{"language":"es","version":"sun","text":"Su corto y fino pelaje percibe los cambios en el aire y esto le permite predecir los movimientos de sus oponentes."},{"language":"en","version":"sun","text":"It can instantaneously sense its opponent’s movements by feeling air currents with its fine fur."},{"language":"ja","version":"sun","text":"細く 短い 体毛で 空気の 流れから 相手の 行動 まで 一瞬で 読み取ってしまう。"},{"language":"fr","version":"moon","text":"Le joyau sur son front projette des ondes psychiques en combat, et s’obscurcit lorsque Mentali est à bout de force."},{"language":"es","version":"moon","text":"Lucha con los poderes psíquicos que brotan de la esfera de su frente, que se oscurece cuando su energía disminuye."},{"language":"en","version":"moon","text":"It unleashes psychic power from the orb on its forehead. When its power is exhausted, the orb grows dull and dark."},{"language":"ja","version":"moon","text":"額の 玉から サイコパワーを 放射して 戦う。 パワーが 尽きると 玉の 色が くすむ。"},{"language":"fr","version":"ultra-sun","text":"À l’origine, il n’était doté d’aucune compétence particulière, mais il a développé un don de prescience pour se défendre."},{"language":"es","version":"ultra-sun","text":"Originariamente, carecía de habilidades especiales, pero terminó desarrollando facultades premonitorias para protegerse."},{"language":"en","version":"ultra-sun","text":"Although it originally had no powers at all, people say its precognitive faculties were awakened by its need to protect itself."},{"language":"ja","version":"ultra-sun","text":"元々は なんの 能力も なかったが 身を 守るために 予知能力に 目覚めたと いう。"},{"language":"fr","version":"ultra-moon","text":"Le joyau sur son front accumulant de la force psychique lorsqu’il est exposé à la lumière du soleil, il préfère les combats de jour."},{"language":"es","version":"ultra-moon","text":"La luz del sol imbuye de poder psíquico la esfera de su frente, por lo que los combates nocturnos son su punto débil."},{"language":"en","version":"ultra-moon","text":"Psychic power builds up in the orb on its forehead as it bathes in the sunshine. Espeon is not good at battling at night."},{"language":"ja","version":"ultra-moon","text":"日光を 浴びていると 額の 玉に サイコパワーが たまっていく。 夜の 戦いは 苦手 なのだ。"},{"language":"fr","version":"sword","text":"En analysant les courants aériens, il peut prédire la météo ou même les mouvements de son ennemi."},{"language":"es","version":"sword","text":"Basándose en las corrientes de aire, predice cosas como el tiempo atmosférico o la próxima acción del enemigo."},{"language":"en","version":"sword","text":"By reading air currents, it can predict things such as the weather or its foe’s next move."},{"language":"ja","version":"sword","text":"空気の 流れを 読みとることで これからの 天気や 相手の 動きなどを すべて 当ててしまう。"},{"language":"fr","version":"shield","text":"Le joyau sur le front de Mentali projette des ondes psychiques en combat, et s’obscurcit quand il est à bout de force."},{"language":"es","version":"shield","text":"Lucha con los poderes psíquicos que brotan de la esfera de su frente, que se oscurece cuando su energía disminuye."},{"language":"en","version":"shield","text":"It unleashes psychic power from the orb on its forehead. When its power is exhausted, the orb grows dull and dark."},{"language":"ja","version":"shield","text":"額の 珠から サイコパワーを 放射して 戦う。 パワーが つきると 珠の 色が くすむ。"},{"language":"en","version":"legends-arceus","text":"Wields an arcane power with which it can predict the weather and even people's thoughts. When bathed in sunshine, the scarlet orb on its brow glows and builds energy."}],"varieties":[{"id":196,"moves":[{"name":"pay-day","learns":[[20,"machine",0]]},{"name":"cut","learns":[[3,"machine",0],[4,"machine",0],[5,"machine",0],[6,"machine",0],[7,"machine",0],[8,"machine",0],[9,"machine",0],[10,"machine",0],[11,"machine",0],[12,"machine",0],[13,"machine",0],[14,"machine",0],[15,"machine",0],[16,"machine",0],[23,"machine",0]]},{"name":"sand-attack","learns":[[3,"level-up",8],[4,"level-up",8],[5,"level-up",8],[6,"level-up",8],[7,"level-up",8],[8,"level-up",8],[9,"level-up",8],[10,"level-up",8],[11,"level-up",8],[12,"level-up",8],[13,"level-up",8],[14,"level-up",5],[15,"level-up",5],[16,"level-up",5],[17,"level-up",5],[18,"level-up",5],[20,"level-up",5],[23,"level-up",5],[25,"level-up",5]]},{"name":"headbutt","learns":[[